{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "glcoge.mai-narrative",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "name": "MaiBot 剧本人设系统",
  "description": "让 bot 活在实时推进的剧本里 —— v0.2.0「三层连续性」：锚定层（人格/世界观/价值观/铁律，永不改变）、慢变区（看法/长期目标/关系，由「证据→提案→门槛→晋升→审计留痕→写回 [learned]→注入」闭环驱动，支持一步回滚）、漂移层（语气/话题/作息/情绪精力，逐轮注入模型请求）。含双层状态机、世界时钟规则推进、创作层生活片段、事件驱动主动消息、睡眠态、编年史双写与表达学习隔离。人设主体复用主程序原生 [personality]，插件只补充世界观与铁律。（v0.1 切片为单人单私聊剧本模式）",
  "author": {
    "name": "glcoge",
    "url": "https://github.com/glcoge"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/glcoge/glcoge-mai-narrative",
    "issues": "https://github.com/glcoge/glcoge-mai-narrative/issues"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.0.0",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.7.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "capabilities": [
    "send.text",
    "config.get",
    "llm.generate",
    "llm.get_available_models",
    "maisaka.proactive.trigger"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN",
    "supported_locales": ["zh-CN"]
  }
}